{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/113873-dtd-abondoned-infrastructures-stimatics-magic-and-demon-cannibalism","id":113873,"title":"DTD, Abondoned infrastructures, stimatics, \"magic\", and demon cannibalism","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-15T23:07:03-07:00","id":113873,"title":"DTD, Abondoned infrastructures, stimatics, \"magic\", and demon cannibalism","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Figured some might find this interesting. My brain was brimming with thoughts from the summoning thread, I was putting down notes, I tried to organize it to post, but it kept getting too long, so I will just leave the notes like it is. Basically I wanted to introduce a \u201cmagic\u201d system to stigmatics that would make them more interesting, but then the ideas kept growing in multiple directions. What would they use for power? Oh an infrastructure? Hey, why does it have to be a new infrastructure? What if it is a used one? Ok, so what does the GM do with former infrastructures? I am sure it still has power and might be still active and can be remade for other purposes, what about demons and angels? They could be a power source, maybe even other stigmatics and even humans and animals, but normals do not give much juice and it would explain why cults hunt certain people out for sacrifices...etc..etc My brain just went everywhere. Anyway, my notes are below.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- What happens to used infrastructures? Some might be safely shut down, while others might just be abandoned after it is used. These abandoned infrastructure assets are can be tapped for power, possible reactivated, repurposed and hacked to do things outside its original function.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- Remember, infrastructures are not just buildings, ANYTHING can theoretically be an infrastructure.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- stigmatics are created when in contact with the god machine, they get visions</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- some stigmatics could get more, they can get access to bits of the source code and secrets. This allows them to have a very very crude understanding of how to tap into these underlying structures of reality, how to tap into infrastructures, even how to make minor infrastructures and occult matrixes.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- these people can code \u201cmagic\u201d that is basically the same as embeds/exploits, but it is more ritualized. It needs a source of power, the code manifested (written runes, concentration, literal code on a computer, ..etc) that creates the embed/exploit.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- The power for this magic has to come from somewhere, infrastructure assets are highly sought out for this, demons/angels also make excellent use as a power source, even other stigmatics make good sources of power (explains the whole, sacrificing \u201cspecific\u201d people in occult lore). Regular people/animals make poor energy sources and several people would have to be sacrificed just for the affect one stigmatic could do.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- This magic only works for stigmatics, EXCEPT for when its done on or near an infrastructure asset. When that happens, the magic works and the person has a strong chance of turning into a stigmatic.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- Stigmatics can teach or pass along knowledge of how this magic works, but only other stigmatics could use it unless near an infrastructure</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- This would open up a whole new purpose for stigmatics. They could have actual teeth and make them more dangerous to demons/angels, who they would hunt down for their power. It also makes stigmatics way more useful and desirable for demons/angels/gm.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- The GM \u201crecycles\u201d demons. Breaking them up and putting them together with different parts (like legos!). So, what if demons can do the same. Ripping parts off from one demon and adding or replacing parts on themselves? As mentioned, demon (and angels) and their parts carry power that could be used in rituals, or improving their own demonic nature, Perhaps stigmatas can graft demon parts on themselves, or maybe it is even possible to make a NEW demon from the remains of demons and angels. Even the remains of angels and demons can have purposes. All sorts of crazy possibilities. </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2356-badmojo","name":"Badmojo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}